        <mxCell id="col6_body" value="[Ứng dụng Phân tích]&#xa;• Tableau Desktop:&#xa;  Port 6543 (Pooler)&#xa;  - Executive Snapshot&#xa;  - Technical Deep-Dive&#xa;  - Anomaly Detection&#xa;• Streamlit Web App:&#xa;  - LightGBM Forecast&#xa;  - SHAP Explainability" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontSize=10;fontColor=#1E293B;spacingTop=4;" vertex="1" parent="1">
